From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Select reconstructed original pose accumulation with native ownership
Upstream-base: 389ec8223cba8dda09934884b1a2967704bec363

Select available original Init/Blend/BuildNodeMatrices equations without changing
the remaining unmatched builder arithmetic. Pair native arrays with game-arena
allocation/free, define scratch storage, and unwind partial construction. Native
copy/assignment, pose-tree evaluation, callbacks and replay remain unselected.
Keep mirrored translation temporaries alive through their actual consumption and
define unused matrix lanes copied by the original quaternion conversion.
The port qualifies hierarchy, numeric domains and publication before execution;
this selection does not claim the still-NonMatching translation unit is matched.

